{"ID":"20240118151041-8eknk1c","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151041-8eknk1c","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151041-8eknk1c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151041-czawmhv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122142915-yaxqtdr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122142915-yaxqtdr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:121,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:121\u0026#125;","title":"250粟米","type":"doc","updated":"20240202103350"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151041-czawmhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151041-czawmhv","updated":"20240122142913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，微寒，无毒。主养肾气：去胃中脾中热，益气。陈粟，味苦，寒，无毒。主胃熟，消渴，利小便。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122142914-qy5rf10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142914-qy5rf10"}},{"ID":"20240122142915-yaxqtdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122142915-yaxqtdr","updated":"20240202103350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"250，就是粟米。我们在北方的杂粮店里面，你如果去看，哇，一票，可能有五六十种，各种不同的，这个五谷杂粮类的东西哦，其中一个粟米黑色的，味咸，微寒，那个粟米的颜色很暗，咸味的药。那一般来说，这种都是杂粮类的药，杂粮类的食物。那你如果说，你吃不习惯这种五谷杂粮类的东西，吃完要拉肚子。实际上这种东西最好。现在改良过的白米并不好。改良后的白米里面，植物纤维少很多，非常得不好。"}]}]}